<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Facture — Perla Body Sculpt</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  :root {
    --bordeaux: #4A111C; --creme: #F3E8DE; --rose: #C9A6A5;
    --dore: #B08D57; --blanc: #FFF9F5; --texte: #5A5A5A;
    --radius: 8px;
    --serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    --sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { background: var(--blanc); -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  body { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--texte); }

  .page {
    width: 210mm; height: 296mm; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 18px 22px; background: var(--blanc);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .page > section { flex-shrink: 0; }

  .header {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center; gap: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bordeaux);
  }
  .header-left { text-align: left; }
  .brand-name { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .brand-info { font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--texte); }
  .header-center { text-align: center; }
  .logo { width: 78px; height: 78px; object-fit: contain; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }
  .header-right { text-align: right; }
  .doc-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; }
  .doc-sub { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--dore); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px; }
  .meta-list { margin-top: 7px; display: grid; gap: 2px; justify-items: end; }
  .meta-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 8px; }
  .meta-row dt { color: var(--texte); }
  .meta-row dd { color: var(--bordeaux); font-weight: 700; }

  .card { background: var(--creme); border: 1px solid var(--rose); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 7px 11px; }
  .card-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bordeaux); padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rose); }
  .info-list { display: grid; gap: 2px; }
  .info-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; gap: 8px; font-size: 8.5px; }
  .info-row dt { color: var(--texte); }
  .info-row dd { color: var(--bordeaux); font-weight: 600; }

  .section-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 2px 0 3px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bordeaux); }
  .section-title::before { content: ""; width: 14px; height: 2px; background: var(--rose); }

  .table-wrap { border: 1px solid var(--rose); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; background: var(--blanc); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; }
  thead th { background: var(--bordeaux); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 8px; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: right; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  thead th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  thead th.c-center { text-align: center; }
  tbody td { padding: 5px 10px; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; color: var(--texte); font-size: 8.5px; }
  tbody td:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tbody td.c-center { text-align: center; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--creme); }
  .amount { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  td.c-total { color: var(--bordeaux); font-weight: 700; }
  tbody tr.subtotal td { background: var(--creme) !important; border-top: 1px solid var(--rose); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); font-family: var(--serif); }
  .col-des { width: 58%; }
  .col-qty { width: 14%; }
  .col-mnt { width: 28%; }

  .grand-total { background: var(--bordeaux); color: #fff; padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .grand-total .label { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; }
  .grand-total .value { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .totals { display: grid; gap: 3px; }
  .total-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; font-size: 9px; }
  .total-row span:last-child { color: var(--bordeaux); font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .total-row.solde { margin-top: 4px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 2px solid var(--bordeaux); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .total-row.solde span:first-child { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); }
  .total-row.solde span:last-child { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bordeaux); }

  .note { font-size: 8px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--texte); padding: 6px 10px; background: var(--creme); border-left: 3px solid var(--rose); border-radius: 4px; }
  .note strong { color: var(--bordeaux); font-style: normal; }

  /* ACCOMPAGNEMENT */
  .accompagnement {
    background: var(--creme);
    border: 1px solid var(--rose);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--dore);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .accompagnement .icon {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--dore);
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .accompagnement .text { font-size: 8.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--texte); }
  .accompagnement .text strong { color: var(--bordeaux); }

  .footer { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }

  /* SIGNATURE SOCIÉTÉ : Cachet + Signature */
  .signature-societe {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .sign-box {
    min-height: 75px;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--rose);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .sign-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--bordeaux); }
  .sign-sub { font-size: 8px; color: var(--texte); }
  .sign-bar {
    margin-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rose);
    padding-top: 4px;
    font-size: 7.5px;
    color: var(--texte);
  }

  .foot-bar {
    display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    gap: 8px; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .15em;
    color: var(--bordeaux); padding-top: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rose);
  }

  @media screen { html, body { background: #E9E2DC; } .page { margin: 24px auto; box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(74,17,28,.15); } }
  @media print { html, body { background: var(--blanc); width: 210mm; height: 296mm; } .page { margin: 0; box-shadow: none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <div class="brand-name">Perla Body Sculpt</div>
      <div class="brand-info">
        22 RUE EMERAUDES, Le Kram, Tunisie<br>
        Tél : +216 26 723 876<br>
        perlabodyartcontact@gmail.com<br>
        MF : 1997944N
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-center">
      <img class="logo" src="{{logoBase64}}" alt="Perla Body Sculpt">
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <h1 class="doc-title">Facture</h1>
      <div class="doc-sub">N° {{numeroFacture}}</div>
      <dl class="meta-list">
        <div class="meta-row"><dt>Date :</dt><dd>{{dateFacture}}</dd></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><dt>Intervention :</dt><dd>{{dateIntervention}}</dd></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><dt>Zones :</dt><dd>{{zonesTraitees}}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Informations patiente</h2>
    <article class="card">
      <dl class="info-list">
        <div class="info-row"><dt>Nom &amp; Prénom</dt><dd>{{patientNomPrenom}}</dd></div>
        <div class="info-row"><dt>Date de naissance</dt><dd>{{dateNaissance}}</dd></div>
        <div class="info-row"><dt>N° CIN / Passeport</dt><dd>{{cinPasseport}}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">1. Détail des prestations médicales</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <colgroup><col class="col-des"><col class="col-qty"><col class="col-mnt"></colgroup>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Désignation</th><th class="c-center">Quantité</th><th>Montant</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Consultation préopératoire</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_consultation}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bilan / examens préopératoires</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_bilan}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Honoraires chirurgicaux</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_honoraires}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Anesthésie</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_anesthesie}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Frais de bloc opératoire</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_bloc}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Séjour en clinique – {{nuitsClinique}} nuit(s)</td><td class="c-center">{{nuitsClinique}}</td><td class="amount">{{m_sejour_clinique}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Soins et surveillance postopératoires</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_soins}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Médicaments et soins postopératoires</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_medicaments}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Vêtement de contention</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_contention}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Drainage</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_drainage}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Supplément accompagnateur</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_accompagnateur}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Contrôle postopératoire</td><td class="c-center">1</td><td class="amount">{{m_controle}} TND</td></tr>
          <tr class="subtotal"><td>Sous-total prestations médicales</td><td></td><td class="amount">{{sousTotalPrestations}} TND</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="grand-total">
      <span class="label">Montant total de la facture</span>
      <span class="value">{{totalFacture}} TND</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="accompagnement">
      <span class="icon">✦</span>
      <p class="text">
        <strong>Accompagnement personnalisé du patient</strong> avant, pendant et après
        l'intervention : coordination des rendez-vous, informations préopératoires et
        suivi postopératoire.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title">Net à payer</h2>
      <div class="totals">
        <div class="total-row solde"><span>Net à payer</span><span>{{netAPayer}} TND</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="note">
      <strong>Informations :</strong> la présente facture correspond aux prestations médicales
      et aux soins effectivement réalisés dans le cadre de l'intervention de la patiente.<br>
      <strong>Intervention réalisée le :</strong> {{dateIntervention}} &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <strong>Zones traitées :</strong> {{zonesTraitees}}
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="signature-societe">
      <div class="sign-box">
        <div>
          <div class="sign-title">Cachet de la Société</div>
          <div class="sign-sub">Perla Body Sculpt</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sign-box">
        <div>
          <div class="sign-title">Signature</div>
          <div class="sign-sub">Le responsable</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot-bar">
      <span>★ PERLA BODY SCULPT &nbsp;·&nbsp; 22 RUE EMERAUDES, Le KRAM, TUNIS ★</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
